{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116986","id":3346298805,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7HdHe1","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116986","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116986.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116986.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116986","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116986/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116986/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116986/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/612475a680178afc6910687c616a054664ccc8f2","number":116986,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Track columns by raw string offsets","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"GDScript keeps track of the position of tokens/nodes/errors/..., however at the moment the column of this position counts tab characters not as one character but by the currently configured tab width. This PR changes this tracking to always count tabs as a single character in position information.\r\n\r\nWith this PR GDScript still tracks positions one-based while other systems use zero-based positions. It's not worth changing that, the conversion isn't complex and there is a lot more stuff which relies on line numbers.\r\n\r\nThis PR also includes a fix to the functionality from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/75216 to actually get the links to jump to the right positions.\r\n\r\n### Motivation\r\n\r\nThis current position format is pretty unusual and requires conversions in adjacent systems. This change in particular is motivated by the language server.\r\n\r\nIn order to convert positions from the parser to something we can send to external editors we always need to be aware of the associated source code. Without going into detail, this isn't exactly great if we want to share more code and utilities between the builtin editor and the LSP implementation.\r\n\r\n_Triage edit: Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117546_\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"